340
00:20:20,780 --> 00:20:23,720
This rope broke at 400,000 pounds,

341
00:20:23,820 --> 00:20:25,780
right where it should have broken.

342
00:20:25,781 --> 00:20:27,780
And as you can see, if we go down here,

