00:20:27,781 --> 00:20:29,780
there's several strands remaining.

344
00:20:29,781 --> 00:20:32,780
And the actual break occurred right here,

345
00:20:32,781 --> 00:20:36,780
which is where the undistorted portion of the rope met

346
00:20:36,781 --> 00:20:38,780
the distorted portion of the rope, which is where it should

347
00:20:38,781 --> 00:20:39,780
have broken.

348
00:20:41,780 --> 00:20:44,780
A 400,000-pound breaking point obviously indicates

349
00:20:44,781 --> 00:20:46,780
huge tensile strength.

