551
00:32:16,800 --> 00:32:19,100
The Germans built the Autobahn,

552
00:32:19,101 --> 00:32:23,100
And the Audubon was concrete that was poured continuously,

553
00:32:23,101 --> 00:32:26,300
and they used the diamond blades to cut the contraction joint

554
00:32:26,301 --> 00:32:28,880
