00:39:46,040 --> 00:39:51,040
This isn't your grandfather's plastic.

688
00:39:51,041 --> 00:39:57,040
In the mid-1800s, inventor John Wesley Hyatt developed celluloid,

689
00:39:57,041 --> 00:40:01,040
